 qī. The meaning widened from an agreed meeting to a date, a deadline and a period. In 星期, week, 期 keeps this sense of a period of time.","roles":{"其":"son","月":"sens"}}},"栖":{"c":"栖","pinyin":"qī","lectures":["qī","xī"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["木","西"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-2622"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"percher ; demeurer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"percher, se poser (oiseau) ; demeurer"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"树上栖息着很多鸟。","pinyin":"Shù shang qīxī zhe hěn duō niǎo.","fr":"Beaucoup d'oiseaux se sont perchés dans l'arbre.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"欺":{"c":"欺","pinyin":"qī","lectures":["qī"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["其","欠"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0635","L7-3182","L7-3183"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"tromper ; brimer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"tromper, duper"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"brimer, maltraiter"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"沏":{"c":"沏","pinyin":"qī","lectures":["qī"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["氵","七","刀"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3179"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"infuser (du thé)","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"infuser, faire (du thé)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我给你沏一杯茶。","pinyin":"Wǒ gěi nǐ qī yī bēi chá.","fr":"Je vais te préparer une tasse de thé.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"漆":{"c":"漆","pinyin":"qī","lectures":["qī"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["氵","木","人","氺"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3184"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"laque, peinture ; laquer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"laque, peinture"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"laquer, peindre"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"门上的漆还没干。","pinyin":"Mén shang de qī hái méi gān.","fr":"La porte vient d'être repeinte, ce n'est pas encore sec.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"其":{"c":"其","pinyin":"qí","lectures":["qí","jī"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L2-0426","L2-0427","L3-0546","L3-0547","L4-0357","L4-0571","L5-0571","L5-0920","L7-1874","L7-2456","L7-2893","L7-2921","L7-3186","L7-3187","L7-3235","L7-3879","L7-4173","L7-5102"],"chemin":{"hsk":195,"lire":20},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"son, sa, ce (pronom écrit)","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"其实我不想去。","pinyin":"Qíshí wǒ bù xiǎng qù.","fr":"En fait, je n'ai pas envie d'y aller.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 其 dessine un van, le panier tressé qui sert à vanner le grain. Les bronzes lui ajoutent en bas un support, qui forme le bas du caractère actuel. Emprunté pour son son comme pronom, « son, sa, ce », il a laissé le sens de van à 箕, écrit avec la clé du bambou.","en":"On oracle bones, 其 draws a winnowing basket, the woven tray used to toss grain. Bronzes add a stand underneath, which became the lower part of today's character. Borrowed for its sound as a pronoun, “his, her, its, that”, it left the basket meaning to 箕, written with the bamboo radical.","roles":{}}},"奇":{"c":"奇","pinyin":"qí","lectures":["qí","jī"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["大","丁","口"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L3-0285","L3-0548","L5-0670","L6-0636","L7-0586","L7-1601","L7-2189","L7-2562","L7-3188","L7-3189","L7-3190","L7-4418","L7-4626"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"étrange, rare ; impair","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"étrange, rare, extraordinaire"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"impair (nombre)","pinyin":"jī"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"旗":{"c":"旗","pinyin":"qí","lectures":["qí"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["方","𠂉","其"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0354","L7-2160","L7-3195","L7-3196"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"drapeau, étendard","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"drapeau, étendard, bannière"}